{"page":99,"width":1858,"height":2374,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"과목 데이터 모일링의 이해","words":[{"text":"과목","x":194,"y":96,"width":55,"height":28},{"text":"데이터","x":312,"y":96,"width":82,"height":29},{"text":"모일링의","x":411,"y":95,"width":109,"height":30},{"text":"이해","x":538,"y":95,"width":55,"height":29}]},{"text":"제3절 모델이 표현하는 트랜잭션의 이해","words":[{"text":"제3절","x":190,"y":243,"width":159,"height":55},{"text":"모델이","x":377,"y":241,"width":148,"height":56},{"text":"표현하는","x":556,"y":242,"width":203,"height":57},{"text":"트랜잭션의","x":784,"y":241,"width":243,"height":56},{"text":"이해","x":1059,"y":240,"width":95,"height":56}]},{"text":"트랜책선은 데이터베이스의 논리적 연산단위다. 흔히 계좌이체를 많이 설명하는데, 이보다 더 적합한 사례는","words":[{"text":"트랜책선은","x":222,"y":388,"width":148,"height":32},{"text":"데이터베이스의","x":386,"y":388,"width":203,"height":33},{"text":"논리적","x":605,"y":389,"width":86,"height":32},{"text":"연산단위다.","x":708,"y":389,"width":151,"height":31},{"text":"흔히","x":875,"y":388,"width":55,"height":32},{"text":"계좌이체를","x":947,"y":386,"width":144,"height":33},{"text":"많이","x":1105,"y":386,"width":55,"height":32},{"text":"설명하는데,","x":1178,"y":385,"width":150,"height":36},{"text":"이보다","x":1346,"y":385,"width":89,"height":32},{"text":"더","x":1450,"y":385,"width":25,"height":33},{"text":"적합한","x":1493,"y":385,"width":89,"height":32},{"text":"사례는","x":1596,"y":384,"width":91,"height":32}]},{"text":"찾아보기가 힘들다. 돈을 보니는 시림의 계최에서 이체금액을 차감하괴 돈-을 받는 사람의 계조}에 이체금액을 가산한다.","words":[{"text":"찾아보기가","x":186,"y":439,"width":140,"height":32},{"text":"힘들다.","x":336,"y":439,"width":90,"height":31},{"text":"돈을","x":438,"y":440,"width":58,"height":30},{"text":"보니는","x":505,"y":439,"width":86,"height":31},{"text":"시림의","x":600,"y":439,"width":83,"height":32},{"text":"계최에서","x":696,"y":440,"width":108,"height":31},{"text":"이체금액을","x":818,"y":439,"width":136,"height":31},{"text":"차감하괴","x":964,"y":437,"width":114,"height":35},{"text":"돈-을","x":1091,"y":438,"width":57,"height":30},{"text":"받는","x":1158,"y":437,"width":57,"height":31},{"text":"사람의","x":1224,"y":437,"width":81,"height":32},{"text":"계조}에","x":1318,"y":436,"width":82,"height":32},{"text":"이체금액을","x":1412,"y":436,"width":142,"height":33},{"text":"가산한다.","x":1564,"y":435,"width":122,"height":33}]},{"text":"즉 계좌이체라는 업무는 이러한 2가지 단계로 진행되며, 데이터 정합성을 위해 위 작업은 전부 실행되든지 아니면","words":[{"text":"즉","x":183,"y":492,"width":30,"height":30},{"text":"계좌이체라는","x":226,"y":489,"width":175,"height":32},{"text":"업무는","x":413,"y":489,"width":87,"height":31},{"text":"이러한","x":513,"y":488,"width":87,"height":32},{"text":"2가지","x":610,"y":490,"width":73,"height":32},{"text":"단계로","x":698,"y":490,"width":86,"height":31},{"text":"진행되며,","x":798,"y":488,"width":119,"height":36},{"text":"데이터","x":934,"y":488,"width":80,"height":32},{"text":"정합성을","x":1030,"y":487,"width":114,"height":32},{"text":"위해","x":1155,"y":488,"width":56,"height":31},{"text":"위","x":1225,"y":488,"width":27,"height":32},{"text":"작업은","x":1266,"y":488,"width":86,"height":32},{"text":"전부","x":1365,"y":488,"width":58,"height":32},{"text":"실행되든지","x":1436,"y":487,"width":144,"height":33},{"text":"아니면","x":1596,"y":486,"width":91,"height":33}]},{"text":"전부 취소되든지 한다. 즉 하나의 업무 단위로 묶여서 처리돼야 한다는 것이고 이러한 업무 단위를 트랜책션이라고","words":[{"text":"전부","x":184,"y":541,"width":55,"height":32},{"text":"취소되든지","x":248,"y":540,"width":138,"height":33},{"text":"한다.","x":466,"y":538,"width":61,"height":32},{"text":"즉","x":540,"y":541,"width":30,"height":30},{"text":"하나의","x":579,"y":539,"width":82,"height":32},{"text":"업무","x":675,"y":541,"width":56,"height":31},{"text":"단위로","x":741,"y":540,"width":83,"height":31},{"text":"묶여서","x":834,"y":538,"width":80,"height":33},{"text":"처리돼야","x":927,"y":538,"width":109,"height":33},{"text":"한다는","x":1045,"y":537,"width":83,"height":33},{"text":"것이고","x":1138,"y":538,"width":84,"height":32},{"text":"이러한","x":1232,"y":538,"width":83,"height":33},{"text":"업무","x":1325,"y":539,"width":55,"height":32},{"text":"단위를","x":1390,"y":539,"width":85,"height":32},{"text":"트랜책션이라고","x":1485,"y":538,"width":202,"height":33}]},{"text":"한다. 여기까지는 익히 알고 있는 내용이다. 그렇다면 업무적으로 발생되는 트랜잭션 말고 모델에도 트랜책션이","words":[{"text":"한다.","x":182,"y":592,"width":66,"height":32},{"text":"여기까지는","x":265,"y":592,"width":148,"height":32},{"text":"익히","x":426,"y":590,"width":54,"height":33},{"text":"알고","x":498,"y":590,"width":59,"height":31},{"text":"있는","x":571,"y":590,"width":59,"height":31},{"text":"내용이다.","x":643,"y":591,"width":124,"height":32},{"text":"그렇다면","x":782,"y":590,"width":115,"height":33},{"text":"업무적으로","x":913,"y":590,"width":144,"height":33},{"text":"발생되는","x":1070,"y":589,"width":116,"height":32},{"text":"트랜잭션","x":1197,"y":590,"width":116,"height":33},{"text":"말고","x":1328,"y":590,"width":59,"height":32},{"text":"모델에도","x":1400,"y":590,"width":119,"height":32},{"text":"트랜책션이","x":1532,"y":590,"width":151,"height":32}]},{"text":"발생할 수 있다는 것을 알고 있는가? 데이터 모델링 진행 시에도 트랜잭션을 표현할 수 있다.","words":[{"text":"발생할","x":182,"y":644,"width":88,"height":32},{"text":"수","x":285,"y":645,"width":30,"height":30},{"text":"있다는","x":332,"y":643,"width":88,"height":32},{"text":"것을","x":435,"y":642,"width":58,"height":32},{"text":"알고","x":509,"y":641,"width":58,"height":32},{"text":"있는가?","x":583,"y":641,"width":98,"height":33},{"text":"데이터","x":698,"y":642,"width":84,"height":31},{"text":"모델링","x":800,"y":641,"width":84,"height":33},{"text":"진행","x":904,"y":642,"width":55,"height":33},{"text":"시에도","x":976,"y":641,"width":87,"height":34},{"text":"트랜잭션을","x":1076,"y":641,"width":147,"height":33},{"text":"표현할","x":1237,"y":641,"width":88,"height":33},{"text":"수","x":1339,"y":643,"width":30,"height":31},{"text":"있다.","x":1385,"y":642,"width":64,"height":31}]},{"text":"IE 표기법","words":[{"text":"IE","x":276,"y":772,"width":25,"height":24},{"text":"표기법","x":314,"y":769,"width":80,"height":29}]},{"text":"주문번호","words":[{"text":"주문번호","x":654,"y":914,"width":121,"height":29}]},{"text":"고객번호","words":[{"text":"고객번호","x":654,"y":985,"width":121,"height":28}]},{"text":"바커 표기법","words":[{"text":"바커","x":279,"y":1108,"width":51,"height":28},{"text":"표기법","x":345,"y":1107,"width":77,"height":29}]},{"text":"주문","words":[{"text":"주문","x":560,"y":1198,"width":56,"height":29}]},{"text":"口 # 주문번호","words":[{"text":"口","x":566,"y":1248,"width":33,"height":31},{"text":"#","x":618,"y":1248,"width":28,"height":31},{"text":"주문번호","x":660,"y":1250,"width":107,"height":27}]},{"text":"口 0 고객번호","words":[{"text":"口","x":567,"y":1283,"width":33,"height":33},{"text":"0","x":620,"y":1294,"width":26,"height":25},{"text":"고객번호","x":660,"y":1287,"width":108,"height":28}]},{"text":"주문상세","words":[{"text":"주문상세","x":989,"y":826,"width":116,"height":29}]},{"text":"주문번호 (FK)","words":[{"text":"주문번호","x":1010,"y":888,"width":118,"height":30},{"text":"(FK)","x":1137,"y":888,"width":64,"height":37}]},{"text":"주문순번","words":[{"text":"주문순번","x":1009,"y":932,"width":117,"height":29}]},{"text":"상품번호","words":[{"text":"상품번호","x":1010,"y":1002,"width":118,"height":30}]},{"text":"주문상세","words":[{"text":"주문상세","x":1020,"y":1179,"width":113,"height":30}]},{"text":"口 # 주문번호 (FK)","words":[{"text":"口","x":1026,"y":1229,"width":32,"height":32},{"text":"#","x":1077,"y":1230,"width":26,"height":30},{"text":"주문번호","x":1115,"y":1231,"width":107,"height":26},{"text":"(FK)","x":1235,"y":1233,"width":48,"height":26}]},{"text":"口 # 주문순번","words":[{"text":"口","x":1026,"y":1264,"width":31,"height":32},{"text":"#","x":1076,"y":1266,"width":27,"height":30},{"text":"주문순번","x":1116,"y":1267,"width":105,"height":27}]},{"text":"口 * 상품번호","words":[{"text":"口","x":1026,"y":1300,"width":32,"height":31},{"text":"*","x":1078,"y":1300,"width":17,"height":17},{"text":"상품번호","x":1117,"y":1301,"width":107,"height":27}]},{"text":"[그림 1-2-18] 주문과 주문상세 모텔 필수 관계","words":[{"text":"[그림","x":624,"y":1402,"width":63,"height":36},{"text":"1-2-18]","x":712,"y":1403,"width":103,"height":35},{"text":"주문과","x":832,"y":1402,"width":82,"height":32},{"text":"주문상세","x":928,"y":1402,"width":107,"height":32},{"text":"모텔","x":1051,"y":1401,"width":55,"height":32},{"text":"필수","x":1122,"y":1402,"width":55,"height":31},{"text":"관계","x":1192,"y":1402,"width":54,"height":32}]},{"text":"고객이 상품을 구매하면서 발생하는 것이 주-문이다. 또한 하나의 주문은 여러 개의 상품을 구매할 수 있다. 이에","words":[{"text":"고객이","x":226,"y":1506,"width":85,"height":33},{"text":"상품을","x":325,"y":1506,"width":89,"height":33},{"text":"구매하면서","x":424,"y":1507,"width":143,"height":33},{"text":"발생하는","x":582,"y":1507,"width":114,"height":33},{"text":"것이","x":708,"y":1507,"width":52,"height":33},{"text":"주-문이다.","x":774,"y":1507,"width":120,"height":33},{"text":"또한","x":907,"y":1506,"width":58,"height":33},{"text":"하나의","x":974,"y":1506,"width":82,"height":33},{"text":"주문은","x":1070,"y":1508,"width":87,"height":30},{"text":"여러","x":1168,"y":1507,"width":55,"height":33},{"text":"개의","x":1238,"y":1507,"width":54,"height":33},{"text":"상품을","x":1306,"y":1507,"width":86,"height":33},{"text":"구매할","x":1403,"y":1509,"width":87,"height":32},{"text":"수","x":1500,"y":1510,"width":31,"height":30},{"text":"있다.","x":1544,"y":1507,"width":64,"height":33},{"text":"이에","x":1624,"y":1507,"width":58,"height":33}]},{"text":"대한 모델이 [그림 1-2-18]이다. 그렇다면 주문과 주문상세의 데이터는 함께 발생되는지, 아니면 독립적으로 발생","words":[{"text":"대한","x":190,"y":1561,"width":60,"height":32},{"text":"모델이","x":260,"y":1559,"width":87,"height":33},{"text":"[그림","x":362,"y":1558,"width":65,"height":37},{"text":"1-2-18]이다.","x":451,"y":1560,"width":164,"height":35},{"text":"그렇다면","x":627,"y":1559,"width":114,"height":33},{"text":"주문과","x":754,"y":1560,"width":86,"height":32},{"text":"주문상세의","x":851,"y":1558,"width":137,"height":33},{"text":"데이터는","x":1005,"y":1558,"width":112,"height":33},{"text":"함께","x":1128,"y":1558,"width":58,"height":33},{"text":"발생되는지,","x":1200,"y":1559,"width":150,"height":35},{"text":"아니면","x":1365,"y":1559,"width":83,"height":32},{"text":"독립적으로","x":1462,"y":1560,"width":148,"height":32},{"text":"발생","x":1623,"y":1559,"width":58,"height":33}]},{"text":"되는지를 생각해보이야 한다. 正 표기법에서는 필수적인(Mandatory) 관계일 경우 관계선 끝에 원을 붙이지 않는다","words":[{"text":"되는지를","x":189,"y":1613,"width":117,"height":32},{"text":"생각해보이야","x":318,"y":1612,"width":174,"height":33},{"text":"한다.","x":502,"y":1612,"width":64,"height":31},{"text":"正","x":580,"y":1615,"width":30,"height":26},{"text":"표기법에서는","x":621,"y":1611,"width":169,"height":32},{"text":"필수적인(Mandatory)","x":802,"y":1611,"width":273,"height":36},{"text":"관계일","x":1088,"y":1611,"width":83,"height":32},{"text":"경우","x":1185,"y":1611,"width":57,"height":32},{"text":"관계선","x":1253,"y":1611,"width":84,"height":32},{"text":"끝에","x":1349,"y":1610,"width":56,"height":33},{"text":"원을","x":1418,"y":1611,"width":58,"height":32},{"text":"붙이지","x":1486,"y":1611,"width":84,"height":33},{"text":"않는다","x":1585,"y":1611,"width":95,"height":32}]},{"text":"바커 표기법은 필수일 경우 관계선을 실선으로 표기한다. 즉 본 모델은 주문이 발생하면 주문상세 데이터도 함께","words":[{"text":"바커","x":190,"y":1664,"width":57,"height":32},{"text":"표기법은","x":261,"y":1664,"width":121,"height":32},{"text":"필수일","x":394,"y":1663,"width":85,"height":33},{"text":"경우","x":495,"y":1664,"width":58,"height":32},{"text":"관계선을","x":564,"y":1663,"width":116,"height":33},{"text":"실선으로","x":693,"y":1662,"width":115,"height":32},{"text":"표기한다.","x":819,"y":1663,"width":119,"height":32},{"text":"즉","x":953,"y":1664,"width":28,"height":30},{"text":"본","x":992,"y":1661,"width":29,"height":32},{"text":"모델은","x":1032,"y":1662,"width":87,"height":32},{"text":"주문이","x":1130,"y":1662,"width":86,"height":31},{"text":"발생하면","x":1232,"y":1661,"width":112,"height":34},{"text":"주문상세","x":1358,"y":1662,"width":115,"height":32},{"text":"데이터도","x":1488,"y":1662,"width":118,"height":32},{"text":"함께","x":1619,"y":1662,"width":60,"height":32}]},{"text":"발생된다는 의미다.","words":[{"text":"발생된다는","x":190,"y":1715,"width":150,"height":33},{"text":"의미다.","x":354,"y":1715,"width":96,"height":31}]},{"text":"104","words":[{"text":"104","x":203,"y":2260,"width":60,"height":29}]},{"text":"전문가 ,까드","words":[{"text":"전문가","x":335,"y":2256,"width":60,"height":29},{"text":",까드","x":405,"y":2256,"width":61,"height":27}]}]}